name: ['Archfiend of Depravity', 'Dragonscale General', 'Flamerush Rider', 'Mardu Shadowspear', 'Sage-Eye Avengers', 'Sandsteppe Mastodon', 'Shamanic Revelation', 'Supplant Form', 'Temur War Shaman']
